                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.51/185: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-24T12:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 24,
                                1921—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 3:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>63. My 45, June 7, 3 p.m. President has asked several times if the Department had
                    replied regarding nomination customs administrator.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
